Move around. Notice that you stopped thinking about splats about two seconds in. That's the point.

## Where this goes

Capture keeps getting easier and rendering keeps getting cheaper, which means the cost of standing up a new world keeps falling. The interesting work now is everything on top: presence, participation, and handing the world to the people inside it. More on that soon.
